      "text": "This is a beautiful country, beautiful people, food, culture, nature, education. It gave me my roots I can ground myself anywhere. People are friendly and humble, hospitality is the sacred tradition, I can keep writing more. This is a beautiful documentary, I felt like swimming again in that underground lake Kow Ata, unforgettable experience. There are many more things about this country which are not even mentioned, like beautiful Firuza, Avaza, much more. I would like to see the University and medical college videos as well. Amazing markets, superstores, breathtaking mountains, more. But even this short video is nice and respectful to the country. Yes, there are a lot of different issues like every country has which can be called negative, but this is a part of overall balance of life in the world we did not create. What I like about this video is that the author  gave the accurate vision of the uplifting spirit of the country which travels from the desert to the mountains to the sea - the space itself. Thank you very much. It was very nice to watch the star sky in the desert, the stars are the closest and the brightest than anywhere else - I used to wake up at 4 am to go to watch since the constellations are changing positions every hour. I can keep writing, but this is enough information to express my gratitude for this video.🥰",
